            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-8 Imgborder" align="justify">
                <h3><b>Common Payment Integration Challenges and How to Address Them</b></h3>
                <p>Retail and e-commerce organizations can face disconnected systems, manual processes, inconsistent customer journeys, limited visibility and operational complexity.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Disconnected Systems:</b> Integrate commerce, retail, inventory, CRM, payment and business systems through connected workflows.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Manual Processes:</b> Automate repetitive activities, approvals, notifications and routine operational tasks.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Limited Visibility:</b> Use centralized dashboards and reports to provide timely insights into operations and customer activity.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Inconsistent Customer Experience:</b> Standardize important customer journeys across digital and physical retail touchpoints.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Security and Data Concerns:</b> Use appropriate access controls, secure integrations and structured data-management practices.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul><br />

                <h3><b>The Importance of Customization in Payment Integration</b></h3>
                <p>Every retail organization has different products, customers, channels, processes and business rules. Customization helps the solution fit the company's operating model.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Customize Business Workflows:</b> Configure payment integration processes around the organization's actual operating model.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Create Role-Based Experiences:</b> Give customers, store teams, administrators and managers the information and actions relevant to their roles.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Automate Notifications:</b> Configure alerts, reminders, approvals and workflow notifications for important business events.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Build Custom Dashboards:</b> Provide role-specific reporting and visibility into key commerce and retail performance indicators.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  <b>Use Customer and User Feedback:</b> Continuously improve the solution based on real-world usage, feedback and business outcomes.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

